                <pb facs="0583" n="499" sameAs="frus:frus1903/pg499"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Mr. Choate.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1903-04-30"><hi rendition="#italic">April 30,
                        1903</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>By agreement of both parties the cases are to be delivered here and in London
                    to-morrow, so as to catch Saturday’s steamer.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hay.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
